 "insight": [
  "Luxembourg's exports to China have decreased since 2015.",
  "The exports started at 212.2 million euros in 2015 and are projected to be 103.0 million euros in 2026.",
  "The highest export value was in 2022, reaching 242.5 million euros.",
  "This shows a peak in 2022 before the decline to 2026.",
  "The data are in current euros and do not account for price changes over time."
